# Files that must not reach the deployment.
#
# This site has no build step: Vercel publishes the repository as-is, so
# every file listed in git is otherwise a public URL. These directories
# are development-time only - nothing the website or the /api functions
# load at runtime - so they are kept out of the deployment entirely
# rather than served and hoped to be ignored.
#
# Anything the functions `require` must NOT be listed here: the bundler
# follows those requires at build time and needs the files present.
# netlify/functions/ is therefore still uploaded (api/*.js wraps it) and
# is blocked at the URL level in vercel.json instead.

# The local Express wrapper around the payment handlers. Only used by
# `npm start` in server/ while developing.
server/

# The image-ladder, i18n build and tagging scripts. Run by hand, locally.
tools/

# The bookings table definition. Applied through the Supabase dashboard,
# never read by the site.
supabase/

# Editor and agent scratch.
.claude/
